  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/12/IMG_7213.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>La Asociaci&oacute;n Rumana de Onda ha celebrado este domingo, 30 de noviembre, el D&iacute;a Nacional de su pa&iacute;s con una jornada de convivencia en el Casal Jove. Adem&aacute;s de los parlamentos oficiales, ha habido folklore y comida t&iacute;pica rumana.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dianacionalromania14/img_7159.jpg\" alt=\"img_7159\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dianacionalromania14/img_7161.jpg\" alt=\"img_7161\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dianacionalromania14/img_7162.jpg\" alt=\"img_7162\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dianacionalromania14/img_7163.jpg\" alt=\"img_7163\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dianacionalromania14/img_7166.jpg\" alt=\"img_7166\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dianacionalromania14/img_7168.jpg\" alt=\"img_7168\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dianacionalromania14/img_7171.jpg\" alt=\"img_7171\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dianacionalromania14/img_7175.jpg\" alt=\"img_7175\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dianacionalromania14/img_7176.jpg\" alt=\"img_7176\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dianacionalroma